{
  "_README": [
    "Group R — slider ranges. Copy to ranges-<car>-<yyyy-mm-dd>.json.",
    "",
    "WHY THIS IS FIRST. The app emits spring rates as absolute lb/in and tells",
    "the user the game clamps to the car's range if it is narrower",
    "(index.html:1379, :2183). It never checks whether the clamp fired. An",
    "asymmetric clamp - front pinned, rear not - destroys the F/R ratio the",
    "whole spring model rests on, silently, on a screen the app cannot see.",
    "",
    "Fill `min` and `max` off the tuning menu by dragging each slider to each",
    "end and reading the value. `appValue` is what the app printed for this car",
    "on a road tune. Run: node tests/status.js"
  ],

  "car": "",
  "class": "",
  "date": "",
  "screen": "tuning menu — slider extremes",
  "build": { "susp": "race", "arb": "both", "diff": "race", "trans": "race",
             "aero": "both", "wt": null, "fw": null, "dt": "", "gears": null },

  "case": "R1+R3",

  "sliders": [
    { "id": "spF",  "name": "Spring rate F",  "vmetaLo": 20,  "vmetaHi": 3000, "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "spR",  "name": "Spring rate R",  "vmetaLo": 20,  "vmetaHi": 3000, "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "arF",  "name": "ARB F",          "vmetaLo": 1,   "vmetaHi": 65,   "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "arR",  "name": "ARB R",          "vmetaLo": 1,   "vmetaHi": 65,   "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "reF",  "name": "Rebound F",      "vmetaLo": 1,   "vmetaHi": 20,   "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "reR",  "name": "Rebound R",      "vmetaLo": 1,   "vmetaHi": 20,   "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "buF",  "name": "Bump F",         "vmetaLo": 1,   "vmetaHi": 20,   "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "buR",  "name": "Bump R",         "vmetaLo": 1,   "vmetaHi": 20,   "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "camF", "name": "Camber F",       "vmetaLo": -10, "vmetaHi": 2,    "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "camR", "name": "Camber R",       "vmetaLo": -10, "vmetaHi": 2,    "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
    { "id": "toeF", "name": "Toe F",          "vmetaLo": -5,  "vmetaHi": 5,    "min": null, "max": null, "appValue": null },
